				<Item class="Script" referent="RBXa2c909152fba4d9f990b3559d036b247">
					<Properties>
						<ProtectedString name="Source">-- Hello ! Thanks for purchashing my model i hope you like it, if you have any questions or suggestions, don't forget to join my group or DM me :)--


--There are some objects that I couldn't create because I don't have the time to do it anymore, so it's up to you to add according to your preferences


	--Since its publication this model is very popular and I thank you from the bottom of my heart, that's why after several years I had to redo everything and update the model

	--everything has been redone with time and love with the f3x tool on the game "Whimsical Building".


--MaelysNath ~ 2023</ProtectedString>
